      "id": "kpk1-l15-e1-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l15-e1-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dzwonię do ciebie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After *do* a pronoun is in the genitive: *dzwonię do ciebie* (I'm calling you), *do niego* (him), *do niej* (her), *do nich* (them), *do mnie* (me), *do nas*, *do was*. *Dzwonić do* is to phone someone. After *do* the pronoun of *on*, *ona* and *oni* begins with *n*."
      },
      "table": {
        "title": {
          "en": "ja, ty, on… · whom? (the genitive)"
        },
